---
import '../design/design-aids.css';
import SketchSheet from '../design/SketchSheet.astro';
import SketchArrow from '../design/SketchArrow.astro';
---
<figure class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface boundary-payment" aria-labelledby="boundary-payment-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Payment crosses a boundary</span>
  <p class="figure-title" id="boundary-payment-title">An order awaiting payment</p>
  <div class="flow">
    <SketchSheet tone="teal"><p class="panel-title">1 · Database transaction</p><p>Reserve the mugs.</p><p>Record the order and lines.</p><strong>Commit: awaiting payment</strong></SketchSheet>
    <div class="connection"><SketchArrow direction="down" /><span>After local commit</span></div>
    <div class="provider"><p class="panel-title">2 · Payment provider</p><p>Request payment using a stable reference for this purchase.</p><strong>Its own operation and outcome</strong></div>
    <div class="connection"><SketchArrow direction="down" /><span>After a confirmed outcome</span></div>
    <div class="choices">
      <SketchSheet tone="teal"><p class="panel-title">3a · Payment confirmed</p><p>In a new transaction, mark the order paid.</p><strong>Stock remains reserved</strong></SketchSheet>
      <SketchSheet tone="amber"><p class="panel-title">3b · Payment declined</p><p>In a new transaction, cancel the pending order and release its stock together.</p><strong>Stock becomes available again</strong></SketchSheet>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="unknown">No confirmed answer? Keep the outcome unresolved and reconcile it with the provider. A timeout does not establish a decline.</p>
  <figcaption>This is a proposed workflow, beyond the article’s runnable schema. The provider is outside both database transactions. The second transaction records a later event; it does not roll back the first commit. Processing a repeated payment result must not release stock twice.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .flow { max-width:35rem; margin:1.2rem auto; }
  .connection { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.8rem; margin:.4rem 0 .4rem 1rem; font-size:.8rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .provider { border-left:2px solid var(--blue); margin-left:.8rem; padding:.6rem 1.2rem; }
  .choices { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1rem; }
  .unknown { padding-left:.9rem; border-left:2px solid var(--gold); }
  @media(max-width:550px) { .choices { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>
